{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議明日舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n2026年亞太經合組織高官會主席陳旭相信，會議一定會取得圓滿成功，會議的成果文件磋商工作已經啟動，在已取得的務實合作成果基礎上，推動發表一份富有雄心的領導人成果文件。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.580872+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:58:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:54:58.863316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:00.784983+00:00","content_hash":"6967139380695eae5e07a83e249381b2656ef3b38189af382f3979e2933c1a20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}